message: If you use this software, please cite it and the upstream package it extends.
title: generalized_replay_classification
abstract: >-
  A fork of replay_trajectory_classification that adds TCM_SR, a successor
  representation continuous dynamic for classifying hippocampal replay, fit by
  expectation maximization.
